- "Utrecht vs Borodino at 12 km: Load HE: AP penetrates on only 37% of the hull it strikes; the rest overpenetrates, ricochets or shatters. It penetrates most of the bow (64%), casemate (61%) and stern (64%), and ricochets off the superstructure and shatters on the citadel armor and turrets. AP still pays off on shots aimed at those zones. HE defeats the first plate on 55% of the area it strikes (superstructure, bow and stern), and every HE hit can start a fire, even one that shatters."
- "Des Moines vs Borodino at 12 km: Load HE: AP penetrates on only 26% of the hull it strikes; the rest overpenetrates, ricochets or shatters. It penetrates most of the casemate (59%) and citadel armor (73%), and ricochets off the superstructure, bow and stern and shatters on the turrets. It also detonates inside Borodino's citadel on 18% of the rays over it. AP still pays off on shots aimed at those zones. HE defeats the first plate on 54% of the area it strikes (superstructure, bow and stern), and every HE hit can start a fire, even one that shatters."
- "Zao vs Borodino at 12 km: Load AP: it gets through the turrets and into the citadel often enough to repay it, although it penetrates on only 31% of the hull it strikes. It penetrates most of the casemate (66%), citadel armor (100%) and turrets (51%), and overpenetrates the bow and ricochets off the superstructure and stern. A hit through a turret's armor can knock the turret out. It also detonates inside Borodino's citadel on 38% of the rays over it. Aim at those zones rather than the superstructure."
- "Des Moines vs Des Moines at 8 km: Load AP: it gets through the turrets often enough to repay it, although it penetrates on only 15% of the hull it strikes. It penetrates most of the citadel armor (100%) and turrets (68%), and overpenetrates the superstructure, stern and bow and ricochets off the casemate. A hit through a turret's armor can knock the turret out. It also detonates inside Des Moines's citadel on 25% of the rays over it. Aim at those zones rather than the superstructure."
